# Jakers Designs — rs-* UI Theme

Reference implementation: `web/src/` in ox_lib. Copy `style.css` CSS variables + `tailwind.config.ts` color/radius mappings into new resources.

## Design language

Dark, flat panels with **lime accent** (`#6e03ff`) --PURPLE HF1. No backdrop blur (CEF-safe). No full-screen dim overlays unless explicitly requested. Panels feel like **context menu cards**: header → inset body → optional keyboard footer.

## Tokens (always use CSS vars, never hardcode hex)

| Token | Value / usage |
|-------|----------------|
| `--rs-accent` | `#6e03ff` — labels, icons, progress fill, badges |
| `--accent-rgb` | `110, 3, 255` — glows, `rgba(var(--accent-rgb), …)` |
| `--rs-accent-hi` | `#8b45ff` — gradient end, bar fill |
| `--rs-panel-gradient` | Flat dark panel bg (respects `--container-transparency`) |
| `--rs-fg` / `--rs-fg-soft` / `--rs-fg-mute` | Primary / secondary / muted text |
| `--rs-danger` / `--rs-warning` / `--rs-success` | Semantic states |
| `--shadow-raised` | Outer panel shadow |
| `--border-radius-scale` | Player HUD setting — wrap radii in `calc(Npx * var(--border-radius-scale))` |

Tailwind: `text-fg`, `text-fg-soft`, `text-accent`, `border-sep`, `bg-[image:var(--rs-panel-gradient)]`.

## Panel shell (copy this structure)

```tsx
// Outer panel — 312px (menus) or 480px (bars / wide panels)
className="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[calc(14px*var(--border-radius-scale))] border-[0.5px] border-white/[0.09] bg-[image:var(--rs-panel-gradient)] [box-shadow:var(--shadow-raised),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.06)]"

// Header
className="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5 border-b-[0.5px] border-sep px-3 py-3"
// Title: text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-fg
// Subtitle: text-[11.5px] text-fg-soft

// Inset body
className="relative min-h-0 p-2"
// Inner: rounded-[calc(10px*var(--border-radius-scale))] border-[0.5px] border-sep bg-[image:var(--rs-panel-gradient)] [box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset_0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.42)]"
// Scroll: sb-scroll + top/bottom fade gradients (see ContextMenu.tsx)

// Footer (keyboard hints)
className="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 border-t-[0.5px] border-sep px-3 py-3"
```

## Accent badge (header top-right)

```tsx
<span className="flex items-center gap-1.5">
  <span className="h-1 w-1 rounded-full" style={{ background: 'var(--rs-accent)', boxShadow: '0 0 5px rgba(var(--accent-rgb),0.8)' }} />
  <span className="font-display text-[8.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style={{ color: 'var(--rs-accent)' }}>Menu</span>
</span>
```

Badge text examples: `Menu`, `Submenu`, `Progress`, `Preview`, `Alert`, `TextUI`.

## Icons

- Use `ContextIconFrame` from ox_lib (or replicate): 34×34 frame, inner `rs-icon-block`.
- **Neutral frame** for list/item icons: `iconRgb="232,232,232"`.
- **Icon color**: always set explicitly — `color="var(--rs-accent)"` or `rgba(255,255,255,0.82)`. Never rely on default accent-tinted frame (reads gold/yellow).
- Key letters in frames: `style={{ color: 'var(--rs-accent)' }}` (not `text-accent` inside `rs-icon-block`).

## List rows (context menu items)

```tsx
className="flex w-full items-center gap-2.5 px-3 py-2.5 hover:bg-white/[0.03] focus:bg-white/[0.04]"
// Title: text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-fg
// Description: text-[11.5px] text-fg-soft
```

## Progress bars

- Track: `h-[3px] rounded-pill bg-white/[0.08]`
- Fill: `linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rs-accent), var(--rs-accent-hi))` via `scaleX(pct/100)` (not width transition)
- Label right: `font-mono text-[9.5px] tabular-nums text-fg-mute`

## Keyboard footer (`Guide` + `Kbd`)

```tsx
// Guide label: font-display text-[8.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] color var(--rs-accent)
// Kbd: h-[20px] w-[20px] rs-icon-block, --icon-rgb: 232,232,232, FA icon inside
```

## Layout & widths

| Component | Width | Position |
|-----------|-------|----------|
| Context menu | 312px | `right-[3vh] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2` |
| List menu | 312px | `left-[3vh] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2` |
| Notifications | 312px | default top-right stack |
| Progress bar / Skill check / Dev panel / TextUI · bottom | 480px | `bottom-[3vh]` or `top-[3vh]` center |
| TextUI · side / top | 312px | `right-[3vh]` or `left-[3vh]` center, or `top-[3vh]` |
| Input dialog (md) | 866px | bottom-center |

Use **`3vh`** viewport offsets (not `vw`/`px` for screen edges).

## HUD perspective (optional tilt)

Split wrapper: outer `rs-tilt-stage-y-right rs-tilt-origin-center-right` (perspective) → inner `rs-tilt-y-right` (rotate). Never combine `translate` + `rotate` on one node. Sync via `data-perspective` on root from `uiSettings` NUI event.

## Server accent colour (ox.cfg)

Default accent is the Jakers RS lime (`jakers` palette, shade 5). Server owners can override without rebuilding:

```yaml
setr ox:primaryColor grape   # any Mantine palette name, or `jakers`
setr ox:primaryShade 9        # 0–9
```

Applied on NUI load via `getConfig` → `applyThemeConfig()` in `web/src/utils/theme.ts` (sets `--accent-rgb`, `--rs-accent`, `--rs-accent-hi`, `--rs-success`).

## Typography

- **Display/body**: Bai Jamjuree (`font-display`, `font-body`)
- **Data/keys/%**: JetBrains Mono (`font-mono`)
- Section eyebrows: `text-[8.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` in accent

## Animation

- Panel enter: framer-motion spring `{ stiffness: 460, damping: 34 }` or opacity-only fade
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (already in `style.css`)

## Do / Don't

**Do**
- Reuse existing ox_lib components (`ContextIconFrame`, `ContextItem`, `Icon`) when in this repo
- Keep NUI backgrounds transparent (`html, body, #root { background: transparent }`)
- Match context menu when restyling legacy ox_lib UI

**Don't**
- `backdrop-filter` (CEF performance)
- Heavy accent gradient icon tiles on every icon (reserved for key badges / CTAs)
- Opaque full-screen backdrops on alerts unless requested
- Old `rs-frame` + `shadow-float` card style for new panels
- Per-card tilt on notification stacks (tilt the stack container once)

## Porting checklist (new resource)

1. Copy `:root` tokens from `web/src/style.css` (lines 15–96 minimum)
2. Copy `.rs-icon-block`, `.sb-scroll`, tilt classes if needed
3. Mirror `tailwind.config.ts` `colors` / `borderRadius` / `fontFamily`
4. Import Bai Jamjuree + JetBrains Mono (see `web/` font setup)
5. Build panel from shell template above; wire HUD vars via `uiSettings` from `/ox_lib` settings

